"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]},{\"color\":\"Dusty Lilac\",\"colorHex\":\"#D6BDC8\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785422484\\/products\\/rcorjbbmzjfdaufiovsc.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785422484\\/products\\/gdruhirsboflmajd9syh.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785422484\\/products\\/elwvhymkv2jsnpeimire.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785422484\\/products\\/jog0cdi3zyuwheuiadax.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785422484\\/products\\/ksmljmyhnx5pdcseeaep.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785422484\\/products\\/rizzitevckpdcmlo9fqd.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785422484\\/products\\/agchoxqcchvcw2ffiz1b.jpg\"],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"S\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"M\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"L\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"XL\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"2XL\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"3XL\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', 0, '66,107', '', '', 0),
(69, 'sailor-cutie', 'Sailor Cutie', 'Set sail for fun with the Sailor Cutie set! Featuring a classic deep navy blue hue contrasted with crisp white trim and charming bow accents, this two-piece crop top and skirt combo delivers a stylish, playful look that stands out.', '', 3599.00, 4499.00, 0, 67, 'SALE', '[\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Navy Blue\",\"hex\":\"#1B2A4A\",\"images\":[]}]', '2026-07-29 15:08:10', 5, '[{\"color\":\"Navy Blue\",\"colorHex\":\"#1B2A4A\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"L\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"XL\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"2XL\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', 0, '67,68,80', '', '', 0),
(70, 'gothic-halter-teddy', 'Gothic Halter Teddy', 'Unleash your inner dark siren in this stunning Gothic Halter Teddy. This fierce piece combines a high-neck, glossy wet-look faux leather with a daring sheer mesh plunge panel that commands attention. Designed for a bold silhouette, it features intricate lace-up detailing down the front and an open back, perfectly blending edgy style with irresistible allure.\n\nKey Features:\n• Elegant high-neck halter design.\n• Fierce, glossy wet-look faux leather finish.\n• Daring sheer mesh plunge panel.\n• Intricate functional lace-up detail on the front.\n• Open back for a dramatic look.\n• Comfortable and flattering cheeky cut.\n• Perfect for costume parties, themed events, or performances.', '', 3999.00, NULL, 0, 67, NULL, '[\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Glossy Black\",\"hex\":\"#0A0A0A\",\"images\":[]}]', '2026-07-29 15:27:44', 5, '[{\"color\":\"Glossy Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#0A0A0A\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"M\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"L\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"XL\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"2XL\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', 0, '67,68,80', '', '', 0),
(78, 'arabian-empress', 'Arabian Empress', 'Captivate the room in the stunning Arabian Empress costume. Designed with a vibrant crimson red sheer silhouette, this exotic piece features an alluring plunging neckline accented with sparkling gold trimming and an attached coin-adorned waist belt. Complete with flowing arm drapes and a high-slit overlay skirt, it delivers a mesmerizing look full of grace and mystery.\n\nKey Features:\n• Vibrant crimson red sheer fabric.\n• Plunging V-neckline with ornate gold trim.\n• Attached waist belt featuring dangling gold coin accents.\n• Elegant, flowing sheer arm drapes.\n• High-slit overlay skirt for a dramatic silhouette.\n• Perfect for themed parties, dance performances, or special occasions.', '', 4299.00, NULL, 0, 67, NULL, '[\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Crimson Red\",\"hex\":\"#D32F2F\",\"images\":[]}]', '2026-07-30 13:55:28', 5, '[{\"color\":\"Crimson Red\",\"colorHex\":\"#D32F2F\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"M\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"L\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"XL\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"2XL\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', 0, '67,68,80', '', '', 0),
(80, 'pinstripe-executive', 'Pinstripe Executive', 'Command attention in the Pinstripe Executive costume. This playful yet edgy set features a pinstripe design accented with a matching choker collar, mini tie detail, and delicate white lace trim. Designed with a cutout bra top and a high-waisted garter bottom featuring lace-up front straps, it delivers a striking and unforgettable look.\n\nKey Features:\n• Classic pinstripe pattern with dark fabric finish.\n• Matching choker collar with a mini necktie accent.\n• Cutout shelf-style bra top for a bold silhouette.\n• High-waisted bottom featuring crisscross lace-up straps and garter details.\n• Delicate white lace trimming along the collar and hemline.\n• Perfect for themed parties, special occasions, or playful evening wear.', '', 3999.00, NULL, 0, 67, NULL, '[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Dark Pinstripe\",\"hex\":\"#111318\",\"images\":[]}]', '2026-07-30 14:09:18', 5, '[{\"color\":\"Dark Pinstripe\",\"colorHex\":\"#111318\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"S\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"M\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"L\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"XL\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', 0, '67,68,80', '', '', 0),
(82, 'scarlet-sorceress', 'Scarlet Sorceress', 'Cast a spell of fascination in the stunning Scarlet Sorceress costume. This enchanting ensemble features a vibrant red sheer mesh fabric complemented by delicate lace cups and dramatic, flowing bell sleeves. Styled with an alluring satin ribbon lace-up front and a matching flared mini skirt overlay, it creates a breathtaking and magical silhouette.\n\nKey Features:\n• Vibrant red sheer mesh and delicate floral lace cups.\n• Dramatic, flowing bell sleeves with lace cuffs.\n• Satin ribbon lace-up front closure detail for a customizable fit.\n• Flared sheer mini skirt overlay with ruffled trim.\n• Lightweight, breathable, and comfortable fabric.\n• Perfect for themed events, fantasy cosplay, or romantic occasions.', '', 4199.00, NULL, 0, 67, NULL, '[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Bright Red\",\"hex\":\"#E51A24\",\"images\":[]}]', '2026-07-30 14:17:29', 5, '[{\"color\":\"Bright Red\",\"colorHex\":\"#E51A24\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"S\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"M\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"L\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"XL\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', 0, '67,68,80', '', '', 0),
(86, 'altar-vixen', 'Altar Vixen', 'Walk down a different kind of aisle in the breathtaking Altar Vixen costume. This striking ensemble features a sheer white corset-style bodice with delicate lace-up detailing, paired with matching briefs, a veil headpiece, gloves, and lace-trimmed stockings. Designed to captivate, it blends bridal inspiration with an alluring, high-fashion silhouette.\n\nKey Features:\n• Sheer white corset-style bodice with front lace-up closure.\n• Matching sheer briefs with attached garter straps.\n• Coordinating sheer veil headpiece and elegant lace-trimmed gloves.\n• Sheer thigh-high stockings with lace floral tops.\n• Lightweight, form-fitting, and comfortable material.\n• Perfect for bachelorette parties, themed events, or special occasions.', '', 4199.00, NULL, 0, 67, NULL, '[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Pure White\",\"hex\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"images\":[]}]', '2026-07-30 14:27:46', 5, '[{\"color\":\"Pure White\",\"colorHex\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"S\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"M\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"L\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"XL\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', 0, '67,80,68', '', '', 0),
(93, 'midnight-bat-vixen', 'Midnight Bat Vixen', 'Embrace the shadows in the striking Midnight Bat Vixen costume. This fierce set features a unique bat-wing inspired cutout bra top, a matching strappy waist harness with statement metal O-rings, and sheer briefs. Completed with a flowing dark cape and lace-topped stockings, it delivers an edgy and unforgettable silhouette.\n\nKey Features:\n• Distinctive bat-wing style cutout bra top.\n• Strappy waist harness with bold metal O-ring hardware.\n• Sheer dark mesh briefs for a seamless look.\n• Flowing sheer black cape with a neck tie closure.\n• Matching black lace-trimmed thigh-high stockings.\n• Perfect for Halloween, themed parties, or alternative cosplay.', '', 4299.00, NULL, 0, 67, NULL, '[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Jet Black\",\"hex\":\"#0B0B0B\",\"images\":[]}]', '2026-07-30 14:43:24', 5, '[{\"color\":\"Jet Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#0B0B0B\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"S\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"M\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"L\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"XL\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', 0, '67,68,80', '', '', 0),
(94, 'tartan-schoolgirl', 'Tartan Schoolgirl', 'Make a playful statement in the Tartan Schoolgirl costume. This charming ensemble features a white push-up bra style top paired with a matching plaid mini skirt overlay complete with attached suspender straps and a cute mini necktie. Designed for a fun and flirty aesthetic, it brings a fresh, academic-inspired twist to your collection.\n\nKey Features:\n• Classic red and black plaid tartan pattern.\n• White structured bra top with plaid trim details.\n• Attached mini skirt overlay with adjustable-look suspender straps.\n• Matching mini necktie accessory.\n• Flattering and comfortable form-fitting cut.\n• Perfect for themed parties, roleplay, or playful costume events.', '', 3999.00, NULL, 0, 67, NULL, '[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]', '[{\"name\":\"White\",\"hex\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"images\":[]}]', '2026-07-30 14:55:15', 5, '[{\"color\":\"White\",\"colorHex\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"S\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"M\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"L\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"XL\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', 0, '67,68,80', '', '', 0),
(95, 'heartbeat-nurse', 'Heartbeat Nurse', 'Pulse quickening style meets playful design in the Heartbeat Nurse costume. This classic medical-themed mini dress features a sharp plunging neckline, contrasting red trim, decorative front buttons, and a matching red medical cross emblem. Completed with a matching nurse cap and sleevelets, it creates a striking and unforgettable look.\n\nKey Features:\n• Crisp white form-fitting mini dress design.\n• Bold red contrasting trim along the collar, sleeves, and hem.\n• Decorative red front buttons and medical cross patch.\n• Matching nurse cap headpiece with cross accent.\n• Separate coordinating sleevelets for a complete silhouette.\n• Perfect for themed parties, cosplay, or special occasions.', '', 4399.00, NULL, 0, 67, NULL, '[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]', '[{\"name\":\"White\",\"hex\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"images\":[]}]', '2026-07-30 15:00:51', 5, '[{\"color\":\"White\",\"colorHex\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"S\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"M\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"L\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"XL\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', 0, '67,68,80', '', '', 0),
(97, 'pulse-strappy-nurse', 'Pulse Strappy Nurse', 'Make hearts race in the alluring Pulse Strappy Nurse costume. This playful lingerie set features a sheer white mesh bodysuit styled with striking red strappy harness details, built-in red medical cross accents on the cups, and delicate white lace trim along the waist. Paired with a matching nurse cap, it creates a captivating and bold silhouette.\n\nKey Features:\n• Sheer white mesh bodysuit base.\n• Bold contrasting red straps and harness lines.\n• Red medical cross emblems on each cup.\n• Delicate white lace trimming along the waist and garter lines.\n• Matching mini nurse cap headpiece included.\n• Perfect for themed parties, special evenings, or playful cosplay.', '', 4399.00, NULL, 0, 67, NULL, '[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]', '[{\"name\":\"White\",\"hex\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"images\":[]}]', '2026-07-30 15:06:17', 5, '[{\"color\":\"White\",\"colorHex\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"S\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"M\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"L\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"XL\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', 0, '67,68,80', '', '', 0),
(98, 'harlequin-rebel', 'Harlequin Rebel', 'Unleash your playful and mischievous side in the Harlequin Rebel costume. This striking two-tone ensemble features a color-blocked red and black faux leather corset top paired with matching strappy bottoms. Completed with a coordinating choker collar and wrist cuffs, it creates a bold, high-energy silhouette.\n\nKey Features:\n• Vibrant red and black color-blocked split design.\n• Structured faux leather corset-style top with supportive cups.\n• Strappy high-waist bottoms with statement O-ring hardware.\n• Matching color-blocked choker collar and wrist cuffs.\n• Sleek, form-fitting, and eye-catching silhouette.\n• Perfect for cosplay, Halloween, themed parties, or special events.', '', 4999.00, NULL, 1, 67, NULL, '[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Red & Black\",\"hex\":\"#D32F2F\",\"images\":[]}]', '2026-07-30 15:24:29', 5, '[{\"color\":\"Red & Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#D32F2F\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"S\",\"stock\":1,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"M\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"L\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"XL\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', 0, '67,68,80', '', '', 0),
(99, 'noir-mesh', 'Noir Mesh', 'Elevate your collection with the captivating Noir Mesh style. This full-length piece features an intricate web pattern that blends open-work fishnet mesh with solid floral lace accents. Designed with stylish multi-strap shoulder details and a seamless full-length fit, it offers a bold and alluring silhouette.\n\nKey Features:\n• Full-length design combining fishnet mesh and intricate floral lace.\n• Multi-strap shoulder detailing for a modern edge.\n• Form-fitting, stretchy fabric that contours to the body.\n• Lightweight, breathable, and comfortable for extended wear.\n• Seamless transition from bodice to full-length coverage.\n• Perfect for special occasions, nightlife, or making a statement in your collection.', '', 1299.00, NULL, 0, 6, NULL, '[\"Free Size\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Black\",\"hex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785498347\\/products\\/vcjjosxsqscvgtdmztmr.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785498347\\/products\\/fxktoqkt70w7fmrgf6dz.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785498347\\/products\\/jtbu2nvxexihzujrwnup.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785498347\\/products\\/vewuv4hy8ddpwjf7vvac.webp\"]},{\"name\":\"White\",\"hex\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785498347\\/products\\/ng5foaixicslesst5mgt.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785498347\\/products\\/obyq6xwnrkvdme9dtsul.webp\"]},{\"name\":\"Red\",\"hex\":\"#DC2626\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785498347\\/products\\/qrxotp1rzhiodw9imwiy.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785498347\\/products\\/c4sqeezuh3h5cqbs1ity.webp\"]}]', '2026-07-31 11:45:48', 5, '[{\"color\":\"Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[\"http