(100, 'luxe-mesh', 'Luxe Mesh', 'Redefine elegance with the striking Luxe Mesh style. This seamless full-length piece features fine, open-work fishnet mesh designed to gracefully contour the body. Built with a sleek scoop neckline and ultra-stretchy material, it offers a sophisticated and minimalist silhouette.\n\nKey Features:\n• Full-length design crafted from fine fishnet mesh fabric.\n• Sleek scoop neckline with a clean, minimalist upper finish.\n• Form-fitting, stretchy construction that beautifully adapts to natural curves.\n• Lightweight, breathable, and soft material for comfortable wear.\n• Seamless transition from top to toe for a flawless look.\n• Perfect for adding a modern statement piece to your collection.', '', 1499.00, NULL, 0, 6, NULL, '[\"Free Size\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Black\",\"hex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[]}]', '2026-07-31 11:50:26', 5, '[{\"color\":\"Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"Free Size\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', 0, '6,68,80', '', '', 0),
(101, 'gothic-net', 'Gothic Net', 'Redefine sophistication with the striking Gothic Net style. This piece features an intricate blend of open-work fishnet mesh and detailed lace patterns, complemented by a unique halter neckline with strappy upper detailing and integrated garter straps. Designed to seamlessly contour the body, it offers a bold and modern silhouette.\n\nKey Features:\n• Full-length design featuring fine fishnet mesh and intricate lace accents.\n• Distinctive halter neckline with striking strappy upper details.\n• Built-in garter style straps connecting to patterned thigh sections.\n• Form-fitting, stretchy construction that beautifully adapts to natural curves.\n• Lightweight, breathable, and soft material for comfortable wear.\n• Perfect for adding a unique statement piece to your collection.', '', 1299.00, NULL, 0, 6, NULL, '[\"Free Size\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Black\",\"hex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[]}]', '2026-07-31 11:53:09', 5, '[{\"color\":\"Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"Free Size\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', 0, '6,68,80', '', '', 0),
(102, 'royal-net', 'Royal Net', 'Redefine elegance with the striking Royal Net style. This seamless full-length piece features fine fishnet mesh accented with unique butterfly and patterned motifs distributed along the silhouette. Built with a classic scoop neckline and ultra-stretchy material, it offers a sophisticated and minimalist look.\n\nKey Features:\n• Full-length design crafted from fine fishnet mesh fabric.\n• Distinctive butterfly pattern accents along the torso and legs.\n• Sleek scoop neckline with a clean, minimalist upper finish.\n• Form-fitting, stretchy construction that beautifully adapts to natural curves.\n• Lightweight, breathable, and soft material for comfortable wear.\n• Perfect for adding a unique statement piece to your collection.', '', 1399.00, NULL, 0, 6, NULL, '[\"Free Size\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Black\",\"hex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[]}]', '2026-07-31 11:57:47', 5, '[{\"color\":\"Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"Free Size\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', 0, '6,68,80', '', '', 0),
(103, 'royal-fringe', 'Royal Fringe', 'Redefine sophistication with the striking Royal Fringe style. This piece features an intricate blend of open-work fishnet mesh and detailed lace patterns, complemented by a unique halter neckline with upper detailing and integrated garter straps. Designed to seamlessly contour the body, it offers a bold and modern silhouette.\n\nKey Features:\n• Full-length design featuring fine fishnet mesh and intricate lace accents.\n• Distinctive halter neckline styling for a modern edge.\n• Built-in garter style straps connecting to patterned thigh sections.\n• Form-fitting, stretchy construction that beautifully adapts to natural curves.\n• Lightweight, breathable, and soft material for comfortable wear.\n• Perfect for adding a unique statement piece to your collection.', '', 1399.00, NULL, 0, 6, NULL, '[\"Free Size\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Black\",\"hex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785499560\\/products\\/hyyjmr0u18elmuloln5w.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785499560\\/products\\/azxkkhkygftlc4juej50.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785499560\\/products\\/envkjwtxxjs6cuk4liwe.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785499560\\/products\\/gjy8fuxdoeoj75yenagp.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785499560\\/products\\/tkkltszzzaieghi9ohfm.webp\"]},{\"name\":\"Red\",\"hex\":\"#DC2626\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785499560\\/products\\/t5yrmxz5qx98gpgldlkn.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785499560\\/products\\/cxuhu4xvlzlgjtu2pl13.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785499560\\/products\\/zgymcftitllyaqo8js3e.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785499560\\/products\\/ldbefcwb