(104, 'night-suit-set-1', 'Night Suit Set', '✅ Premium Cotton Fabric\nCrafted from soft, high-quality cotton fabric that is lightweight, breathable, and helps wick away moisture for lasting comfort.\n\n✅ Soft & Comfortable Fit\nDesigned with a relaxed fit that allows easy movement, making it ideal for sleeping, lounging, or relaxing at home.\n\n✅ Elegant Printed Design\nFeaturing a stylish navy blue half-sleeve top paired with attractive printed pajama trousers, giving you a modern and fashionable bedtime look.\n\n✅ Skin-Friendly Material\nMade with gentle, breathable fabric that feels soft against the skin and provides all-night comfort.\n\n✅ Elastic Waistband\nThe comfortable elastic waistband offers a secure yet flexible fit for everyday wear.\n\n✅ Perfect for Every Season\nLightweight cotton fabric makes it suitable for summer, spring, and indoor wear throughout the year.\n\n✅ Everyday Sleepwear\nWhether you\'re enjoying a peaceful night\'s sleep or spending a relaxing day at home, this pajama set is the perfect choice.', '', 2900.00, 3500.00, 0, 66, NULL, '[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Warm Beige\",\"hex\":\"#D2C0B1\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785499633\\/products\\/lmdugxzodyprp0wj6i7j.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785499633\\/products\\/yz1s3dlp5uxndolwfg5i.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785499633\\/products\\/c6ymi6qaofqprynzvotv.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785499633\\/products\\/cueijcox9qyqfxmwrcu8.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785499633\\/products\\/gjjx6sso75hewg5znv4d.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785499634\\/products\\/vj0bvzq5s0mujgj6nusx.jpg\"]},{\"name\":\"Midnight Navy\",\"hex\":\"#1C2238\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/uploa