(105, 'strappy-neck', 'Strappy Neck', 'Redefine sophistication with the striking Strappy Neck style. This full-length piece features an intricate blend of open-work fishnet mesh and detailed lace patterns, complemented by a unique halter neckline with striking strappy upper details. Designed to seamlessly contour the body, it offers a bold and modern silhouette.\n\nKey Features:\n• Full-length design featuring fine fishnet mesh and intricate lace accents.\n• Distinctive halter neckline with striking strappy upper details.\n• Form-fitting, stretchy construction that beautifully adapts to natural curves.\n• Lightweight, breathable, and soft material for comfortable wear.\n• Seamless transition from top to toe for a flawless look.\n• Perfect for adding a unique statement piece to your collection.', '', 1499.00, NULL, 0, 6, NULL, '[\"Free Size\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Black\",\"hex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[]}]', '2026-07-31 12:09:20', 5, '[{\"color\":\"Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"Free Size\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', 0, '6,68,80', '', '', 0),
(106, 'feline-lace', 'Feline Lace', 'Make a playful and captivating statement with the stunning Feline Lace style. This complete ensemble features a fine fishnet bodysuit paired with built-in garter straps and matching lace-trimmed stockings, perfectly complemented by a cute lace ear headband. Designed to gracefully contour the body, it offers a bold and alluring silhouette.\n\nKey Features:\n• Complete set including a fine fishnet bodysuit, attached garter straps, and stockings.\n• Includes a playful lace cat-ear headband for a complete look.\n• Delicate floral lace accents along the bust and top thighs.\n• Form-fitting, stretchy construction that beautifully adapts to natural curves.\n• Lightweight, breathable, and soft material for comfortable wear.\n• Perfect for special occasions, themed evenings, or adding a unique touch to your collection.', '', 1499.00, NULL, 0, 6, NULL, '[\"Free Size\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Black\",\"hex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785500263\\/products\\/xdt71uylyccequwtwefi.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785500263\\/products\\/rgoxzxyb0rny3xkxonkq.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785500263\\/products\\/qfkinwxbav8aficodhkc.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785500263\\/products\\/d3uyarz4liojengucpue.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785500263\\/products\\/oaxsouclznqpdxwz3u2b.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785500263\\/products\\/kiaqcynuozklnwguudxc.webp\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785500263\\/products\\/vo74khxmooyeodh36mri.webp\"]}]', '2026-07-31 12:17:44', 5, '[{\"color\":\"Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785500263\\/products\\/xdt71uylyccequwtwefi.webp\",\"https: