(108, 'halter-mesh', 'Halter Mesh', 'Redefine sophistication with the striking Halter Mesh style. This seamless full-length piece features an intricate blend of open-work fishnet mesh and detailed lace patterns along the bodice, complemented by a fitted halter neckline. Designed to gracefully contour the body, it offers a bold and modern silhouette.\n\nKey Features:\n• Full-length design featuring fine fishnet mesh and intricate lace accents.\n• Distinctive halter neckline styling for a sleek, modern edge.\n• Form-fitting, stretchy construction that beautifully adapts to natural curves.\n• Lightweight, breathable, and soft material for comfortable wear.\n• Seamless transition from top to toe for a flawless look.\n• Perfect for adding a unique statement piece to your collection.', '', 1399.00, NULL, 0, 6, NULL, '[\"Free Size\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Black\",\"hex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[]}]', '2026-07-31 12:25:36', 5, '[{\"color\":\"Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"Free Size\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', 0, '6,68,80', '', '', 0),
