(250, 'body-colette', 'Body Colette', 'Turn up the heat with this seductive high-leg thong body, designed with sheer lace panels and striking strap details. The daring cut creates a flattering silhouette, while the high-leg design elongates the body for an irresistible look. Finished with adjustable straps, elegant chain accents and a thong back for minimal coverage. Perfect for adding a bold and luxurious touch to your lingerie collection.\n\nHalter\nSemi-transparent\nHigh leg string\nMesh Details\nMinimal back coverage', '', 3700.00, NULL, 0, 109, NULL, '[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Pink\",\"hex\":\"#E11D48\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1790177373\\/products\\/tm6gxofq0vxc3dnigtnz.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1790177374\\/products\\/zb5yuugsvqrwrwy7owuq.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1790177373\\/products\\/bvs9tvzfkokhkewtwzeg.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1790177373\\/products\\/zz62sb89bmibirxx8frq.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1790177373\\/products\\/b4scg0nlz43zvkoxjotp.jpg\"]}]', '2026-09-23 15:29:34', 5, '[{\"color\":\"Pink\",\"colorHex\":\"#E11D48\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1790177373\\/products\\/kmahxw8p1igxtv3ernbl.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1790177374\\/products\\/g78uzwmhzvskcylhapxf.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1790177373\\/products\\/cjlv94mqtlifkifytiak.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1790177373\\/products\\/qy7edxzlnpvk1lgps0ms.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1790177373\\/products\\/ej1g6u3catkyapyvdlwy.jpg\"],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"S\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\":\"M\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"},{\"size\"