(100, 'Redefine elegance with the striking Luxe Mesh style. This seamless full-length piece features fine, open-work fishnet mesh designed to gracefully contour the body. Built with a sleek scoop neckline and ultra-stretchy material, it offers a sophisticated and minimalist silhouette.\n\nKey Features:\n• Full-length design crafted from fine fishnet mesh fabric.\n• Sleek scoop neckline with a clean, minimalist upper finish.\n• Form-fitting, stretchy construction that beautifully adapts to natural curves.\n• Lightweight, breathable, and soft material for comfortable wear.\n• Seamless transition from top to toe for a flawless look.\n• Perfect for adding a modern statement piece to your collection.', '', '[\"Free Size\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Black\",\"hex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[]}]', '[{\"color\":\"Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"Free Size\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', '', '', '2026-09-24 10:14:02'),
(101, 'Redefine sophistication with the striking Gothic Net style. This piece features an intricate blend of open-work fishnet mesh and detailed lace patterns, complemented by a unique halter neckline with strappy upper detailing and integrated garter straps. Designed to seamlessly contour the body, it offers a bold and modern silhouette.\n\nKey Features:\n• Full-length design featuring fine fishnet mesh and intricate lace accents.\n• Distinctive halter neckline with striking strappy upper details.\n• Built-in garter style straps connecting to patterned thigh sections.\n• Form-fitting, stretchy construction that beautifully adapts to natural curves.\n• Lightweight, breathable, and soft material for comfortable wear.\n• Perfect for adding a unique statement piece to your collection.', '', '[\"Free Size\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Black\",\"hex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[]}]', '[{\"color\":\"Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"Free Size\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', '', '', '2026-09-24 10:14:02'),
(102, 'Redefine elegance with the striking Royal Net style. This seamless full-length piece features fine fishnet mesh accented with unique butterfly and patterned motifs distributed along the silhouette. Built with a classic scoop neckline and ultra-stretchy material, it offers a sophisticated and minimalist look.\n\nKey Features:\n• Full-length design crafted from fine fishnet mesh fabric.\n• Distinctive butterfly pattern accents along the torso and legs.\n• Sleek scoop neckline with a clean, minimalist upper finish.\n• Form-fitting, stretchy construction that beautifully adapts to natural curves.\n• Lightweight, breathable, and soft material for comfortable wear.\n• Perfect for adding a unique statement piece to your collection.', '', '[\"Free Size\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Black\",\"hex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[]}]', '[{\"color\":\"Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"Free Size\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', '', '', '2026-09-24 10:14:02'),
