(111, 'Make a bold statement with the striking Crop Net style. This coordinated set features a long-sleeve cropped mesh top paired with a high-waisted garter belt and matching patterned stockings. Designed with an intricate open-work knit pattern running down the arms and legs, it offers a modern, edgy silhouette.\n\nKey Features:\n• Two-piece set including a long-sleeve crop top and integrated garter stockings.\n• Distinctive vertical open-knit pattern details along the sleeves and legs.\n• High-waisted garter belt styling for a secure and sleek fit.\n• Form-fitting, stretchy construction that beautifully adapts to natural curves.\n• Lightweight, breathable, and soft material for comfortable wear.\n• Perfect for adding a contemporary statement piece to your collection.', '', '[\"Free Size\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Black\",\"hex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[]}]', '[{\"color\":\"Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"Free Size\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', '', '', '2026-09-24 10:14:02'),
(112, 'Make a bold statement with the striking Keyhole Net style. This seamless full-length piece features a uniform open-work fishnet mesh design complemented by a distinctive keyhole cutout neckline with a slim halter strap. Designed to seamlessly contour the body, it offers a modern and daring silhouette.\n\nKey Features:\n• Full-length design crafted from uniform fine fishnet mesh fabric.\n• Distinctive keyhole cutout detail at the bust with a sleek halter neck strap.\n• Form-fitting, stretchy construction that beautifully adapts to natural curves.\n• Lightweight, breathable, and soft material for comfortable wear.\n• Seamless transition from top to toe for a clean look.\n• Perfect for adding a unique statement piece to your collection.', '', '[\"Free Size\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Black\",\"hex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[]}]', '[{\"color\":\"Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"Free Size\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', '', '', '2026-09-24 10:14:02'),
