(114, 'Make a distinct statement with the striking Vertical Stripe style. This full-length seamless piece features a bold vertical striped knit pattern running continuously from top to toe, creating an elongated and modern silhouette with a comfortable halter-style neckline.\n\nKey Features:\n• Full-length design featuring prominent vertical striped mesh patterns.\n• Halter-style neckline for a clean and sleek upper finish.\n• Form-fitting, stretchy construction that beautifully adapts to natural curves.\n• Lightweight, breathable, and soft material for comfortable wear.\n• Seamless transition from top to toe for a streamlined look.\n• Perfect for adding a unique linear statement piece to your collection.', '', '[\"Free Size\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Black\",\"hex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[]}]', '[{\"color\":\"Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[],\"sizes\":[{\"size\":\"Free Size\",\"stock\":0,\"sku\":\"\"}]}]', '', '', '2026-09-24 10:14:02'),
(115, '✅ PREMIUM COTTON FABRIC — Crafted from soft, breathable, premium-quality cotton that gently absorbs moisture, keeping you cool, fresh, and comfortable throughout the night.\n\n✅ STYLISH & ELEGANT DESIGN — Designed with a modern and graceful look, this nightwear combines style and comfort, making it perfect for sleeping, lounging, and relaxing at home.\n\n✅ RELAXED & COMFORTABLE FIT — Tailored with a cozy fit that offers freedom of movement while providing a flattering and comfortable feel all day and night.\n\n✅ SOFT, SKIN-FRIENDLY & BREATHABLE — Lightweight, gentle on the skin, and made for everyday wear, ensuring maximum comfort in every season.\n\n✅ PERFECT FOR A RESTFUL NIGHT — Sleep peacefully and wake up refreshed with this premium-quality nightwear, thoughtfully designed to deliver the perfect balance of comfort, style, and durability.', '', '[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Bubblegum Pink\",\"hex\":\"#E85FA0\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785501261\\/products\\/ldlxfzo8qzppncsb9jrl.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785501261\\/products\\/jqcwyubhc1nxmpnam6au.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785501261\\/products\\/v9xxgfsedpdipuolrvg0.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785501261\\/products\\/ycwuxpora6hoejp4td5m.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785501262\\/products\\/pa35nlzyv85rk5qcypy0.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785501262\\/products\\/ynmc9sq11swtlqpsbi6u.jpg\"]}]', '[{\"color\":\"Bubblegum Pink\",\"colorHex\":\"#E85FA0\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785501261\\/products\\/ldlxfzo8qzppncsb9jrl.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1785501261\\/products\\/jqcwyubhc1nxmpnam6au.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.clo