(243, 'Elevate your nighttime elegance with the stunning Noir Chemise. This delicate, sheer mesh babydoll features intricate floral lace detailing scattered across the bodice and hemline, paired with adjustable thin straps and a charming front tie-accent keyhole. Designed with a flowing, lightweight silhouette, it offers an effortlessly graceful and alluring look.\n\nKey Features:\n• Sheer mesh fabric adorned with delicate floral lace appliqués.\n• Elegant V-neckline with adjustable spaghetti straps and a center bow tie.\n• Flowing, lightweight mini length for a comfortable and graceful drape.\n• Form-fitting yet relaxed silhouette that flatters natural curves.\n• Includes a matching minimal bottom piece to complete the set.\n• Perfect for a sophisticated evening or adding a timeless piece to your collection.', '', '[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Black\",\"hex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788863518\\/products\\/a3uzdhwekbxu8xru8yb8.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788863518\\/products\\/g3vv22mlkjjdmtda9nul.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788863518\\/products\\/agiftuicry0aasr9tegd.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788863518\\/products\\/trtjt7aeho7ry7lnviop.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788863518\\/products\\/nx7saynbqhvo5xu4drww.avif\"]}]', '[{\"color\":\"Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788863518\\/products\\/a3uzdhwekbxu8xru8yb8.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788863518\\/products\\/g3vv22mlkjjdmtda9nul.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788863518\\/products\\/agiftuicry0aasr9tegd.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788863