(244, 'Make a striking statement with the bold Royal Blue bodysuit. This piece features a captivating blend of vibrant blue floral lace appliqués contrasted against sheer black mesh, styled with a modern strappy neckline, delicate ring hardware details, and an alluring high-cut silhouette. Designed to beautifully accentuate curves, it offers a dramatic and sophisticated look.\n\nKey Features:\n• Sheer mesh foundation contrasted with vibrant royal blue floral lace details.\n• Strappy neckline accents paired with adjustable straps for a secure fit.\n• Elegant ring hardware and center-front cutout styling.\n• Form-fitting, stretchy silhouette designed to gracefully adapt to natural curves.\n• High-cut leg design for an elongated and modern look.\n• Perfect for adding a bold, colorful statement piece to your collection.', '', '[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\"]', '[{\"name\":\"Royal Blue & Classic Black\",\"hex\":\"#4169E1\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788865681\\/products\\/nlchb7rz9q4v7xkrdlut.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788865681\\/products\\/kz16hc3efsxc1frfj8et.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788865681\\/products\\/fmttyld6fkn3hihzr3gv.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788865681\\/products\\/zymajlmtdojn7ctezv26.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788865681\\/products\\/gryttbjr08gnr8fffveg.avif\"]}]', '[{\"color\":\"Royal Blue & Classic Black\",\"colorHex\":\"#4169E1\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788865681\\/products\\/nlchb7rz9q4v7xkrdlut.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788865681\\/products\\/kz16hc3efsxc1frfj8et.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788865681\\/products\\/fmttyld6fkn3hihzr3gv.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloud