(246, 'Layer yourself in sheer elegance with the stunning Lace Robe. Crafted from delicate, open-weave floral lace, this lightweight layering piece features an open front design, wide three-quarter length sleeves, and a matching tie belt to gracefully cinch the waist. Perfect for elevating your lounge and sleepwear wardrobe with a touch of timeless sophistication.\n\nKey Features:\n• Premium sheer floral lace construction with a soft and intricate pattern.\n• Open-front silhouette featuring wide, comfortable sleeves.\n• Includes a matching self-tie fabric belt for a customized, flattering fit.\n• Lightweight, breezy drape designed for effortless layering over intimate wear.\n• Adds an air of classic luxury and refinement to your nightwear collection.', '', '[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]', '[{\"name\":\"White\",\"hex\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788867377\\/products\\/g82budetwkoqwl5p79b7.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788867377\\/products\\/phddcj34vvu25k1xpbnk.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788867377\\/products\\/apib814nut5rqrpbmh2p.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788867377\\/products\\/uppbetszl6xsp1vlfkzu.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788867377\\/products\\/rjdf1gifmf7ytass6ls1.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788867377\\/products\\/ga2m7n7lyvxhzo60vdsa.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788867376\\/products\\/rfnwt7mlgt1balbhfrr2.avif\"]}]', '[{\"color\":\"White\",\"colorHex\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788867377\\/products\\/g82budetwkoqwl5p79b7.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dhlvm5n1q\\/image\\/upload\\/v1788867377\\/products\\/phddcj34vvu25k1xpbnk.avif\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.co